doc:Factsarticle1_52 schema:abstract "Accurate prediction of tool wear improves machining quality in intelligent manufacturing. The proposed method integrates a nonlinear mean function and a multi-kernel Gaussian Process Regression model with an LSTM-enhanced particle filter algorithm. The LSTM network is incorporated into the state transition model to dynamically adjust particle weight distributions and improve state estimation accuracy."@en .
